00:12:42.230 --> 00:12:43.230
Makan saja makananmu.

00:12:46.553 --> 00:12:47.553
Kau orang aneh sialan!

00:12:48.025 --> 00:12:49.115
Kesini.

00:12:49.116 --> 00:12:50.636
Sepanjang malam bersamamu, kau sialan.

00:12:51.366 --> 00:12:52.366
Cukup.

00:12:55.876 --> 00:12:56.999
