00:17:00.204 --> 00:17:01.204
Badut?

00:17:01.244 --> 00:17:02.244
Aku serius.

00:17:03.874 --> 00:17:05.582
Yah, kau benar-benar berpikir

00:17:05.796 --> 00:17:07.029
