00:17:18.398 --> 00:17:19.918
Aku seharusnya membiarkanmu mengemudi.

00:17:20.157 --> 00:17:22.195
Ya, seharusnya.

00:17:23.151 --> 00:17:25.999
Tetapi seperti biasa, kau
harus jadi orang baik hati.

00:17:26.278 --> 00:17:27.278
Jadi kitapun di sini.

00:17:27.360 --> 00:17:27.874
Terjebak.

00:17:28.374 --> 00:17:29.527
Seperti sepasang bajingan.

00:17:43.575 --> 00:17:44.575
Steve!

00:18:15.552 --> 00:18:16.342
Tolong!

00:18:16.343 --> 00:18:17.539
